{"etape": 25, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T12:51:14.175443Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "Here's what I found across your reservations. Note that **WUNA5K** (ORD↔PHL, May 10–11) is already in the past, so it isn't eligible for changes.\n\n**NM1VX1** — Round trip MSP↔EWR, *Basic Economy* (passenger: Yara Silva)\n- HAT300: MSP→EWR, May 25, 06:00–09:00 → **3h 00m**\n- HAT208: EWR→MSP, May 27, 00:00–03:00 → **3h 00m**\n\n**KC18K6** — One way MSP→CLT, *Basic Economy* (passenger: Sophia Silva)\n- HAT300: MSP→EWR, May 21, 06:00–09:00 → 3h 00m\n- 2h 00m layover in EWR\n- HAT215: EWR→CLT, May 21, 11:00–13:00 → 2h 00m\n- **Total including layover: 7h 00m**\n\n**S61CZX** — Round trip LAX↔CLT via EWR, *Economy* (passenger: Harper Jackson)\n- HAT228: LAX→EWR, May 23, 20:00–01:30(+1) → **5h 30m**\n- 13h 30m layover in EWR\n- HAT043: EWR→CLT, May 24, 15:00–17:00 → 2h 00m\n- HAT157: CLT→EWR, May 24, 23:00–01:00(+1) → 2h 00m\n- 6h 00m layover in EWR\n- HAT041: EWR→LAX, May 25, 07:00–12:30 → **5h 30m**\n\n**H8Q05L** — One way JFK→ATL, *Basic Economy* (passenger: Harper Kovacs)\n- HAT268: JFK→ATL, May 24, 07:00–09:30 → **2h 30m**\n\nA few things to clarify before I make any changes:\n\n1. For \"flights longer than 4 hours\" — do you mean **individual flight segments** over 4h (that would be HAT228 and HAT041, both in S61CZX), or the **total journey including layovers** (which would also add S61CZX's outbound/return and KC18K6's 7h)?\n2. For \"3 hours or less including layovers\" — same question, since e.g. KC18K6's individual segments are ≤3h but the full journey with the layover is 7h.\n\nOnce you confirm the criteria, I'll tell you exactly which qualify for cancellation and which could be upgraded to business (note that upgrades would incur a fare difference if the business price is higher)."}, "resultat": "Thanks for breaking that down for me!\n\nTo clarify, for the cancellations, I mean the **total journey including layovers** if the entire trip is 